KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ the last alternative: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A guard for the matching of partial specializations with empty packs
(cpp11_partial_specialization_nested_pack_empty): filling an empty
top-level pack made the instantiation take an extra `empty' argument, and
`found no match for symbol 'g'' followed (std::to_chars with GCC 11's
headers lost its body).
